{"id":5392,"author":"Mooch24","body":"This is it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eToontown Rewritten has been released and is open for public beta. You can que yourself in this small line and wait for the magic to shower upon your innocent souls.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThose of you who don't know, this is the game in a nutshell.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LfsdCfj.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/lTw6ezw.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/3zLhcsW.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/C4BEhAx.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/TObhJwA.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI mean, look at those graphics. It's like you're really there.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis here is my que time. I'll be there in no time.... Right? \u003cbr\u003eWell worth it of course.\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/z5fQfmx.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis game will break records.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCheck out this sweet interface that greets you to join the fun.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/L4ZxGdr.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/f4ADEry.png\"\u003e","body_tagged":"This is it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eToontown Rewritten has been released and is open for public beta. You can que yourself in this small line and wait for the magic to shower upon your innocent souls.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThose of you who don't know, this is the game in a nutshell.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LfsdCfj.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/lTw6ezw.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/3zLhcsW.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/C4BEhAx.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/TObhJwA.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI mean, look at those graphics. It's like you're really there.\u003cbr\u003e\u